# Milestone 3 needs no manual environment variables, credentials, or OpenAI API key.
# No .env file is loaded by the current application code.
# Local URLs are fixed in the Vite configs and API entry point; see README.md.
# Playwright alone sets VERIQA_TEST_MODE=1 for state reset and a fixed test clock.
# Normal demo startup must leave VERIQA_TEST_MODE unset (no test-control routes).
# Later milestones will add documented server-only settings here when needed.
